<div class="focus-collection" id="focus">
<section class="section focus-section" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="focus-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Core activities · Focus areas</p><h2 id="focus-heading">Five ways to build a <em>brighter future.</em></h2></div><p>Our work connects education, health and livelihoods—supporting young girls, women, youth and the wider community.</p></div>
    <div class="focus-grid">
      <article class="focus-card focus-education"><span class="focus-index">01 / LEARN</span><div class="focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M7 11.5c6.4-2.2 12.1-.7 17 3.1v25c-4.9-3.8-10.6-5.3-17-3.1v-25Zm34 0c-6.4-2.2-12.1-.7-17 3.1v25c4.9-3.8 10.6-5.3 17-3.1v-25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 14.5v25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m29 29 3 3 7-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>Education support</h3><p>Advocacy for quality education; school assistance, supplies, mentorship, literacy and skills development for children and youth, with a focus on girls.</p><span class="focus-note">Help learners access education and encouragement.</span><a href="#program" class="focus-link">Explore education support <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="focus-index">02 / GROW</span><div class="focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M24 40V22m0 7c-8 0-13-4-14-12 8 0 13 4 14 12Zm0-5c0-8 5-13 14-14 0 8-5 13-14 14ZM12 40h24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>Livelihood support</h3><p>Agriculture support, sustainable livelihoods and community resources.</p><span class="focus-note">Strengthen the resources people rely on.</span><a href="#support" class="focus-link">Ask about livelihood work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="focus-index">03 / THRIVE</span><div class="focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M24 40s-17-10-17-22a9 9 0 0 1 17-4 9 9 0 0 1 17 4c0 12-17 22-17 22Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 17v13m-6.5-6.5h13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><h3>Community health promotion</h3><p>Awareness campaigns, preventive health and hygiene education, healthcare access and support services for underserved communities.</p><span class="focus-note">Promote health knowledge, prevention and wellbeing.</span><a href="#support" class="focus-link">Discuss health support <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="focus-index">04 / BUILD</span><div class="focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M8 20h32v20H8V20Zm-3 0 19-13 19 13H5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 26v8m8-8v8m8-8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18 40V30h12v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>Economic empowerment</h3><p>Vocational and entrepreneurship skills, mentorship, savings groups and income-generating opportunities for women and youth.</p><span class="focus-note">Build skills and opportunities for self-reliance.</span><a href="#support" class="focus-link">Explore a partnership <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="focus-index">05 / PARTNER</span><div class="focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M5 38c0-7 5-11 12-11 4 0 7 1 9 4m17 7c0-7-5-11-11-11-3 0-6 1-8 3m-8 8 6-6 6 6m-6-6v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>Strategic partnerships</h3><p>Build partnerships that connect people and resources to community priorities and lasting transformation.</p><span class="focus-note">Work alongside us to support community-led change.</span><a href="#support" class="focus-link">Partner with us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
